        "Systemic vascular resistance increased; pulmonary vascular resistance decreased; left ventricular contribution to systemic blood flow increased",
        "Systemic vascular resistance increased; pulmonary vascular resistance increased; left ventricular contribution to systemic blood flow decreased",
